        ontoksd:CA_Task410_CM08_Learning,
        ontoksd:CA_Task410_CM20_Learning ;
    ontoksd:hasInstructionalStatement "Display counts by club, separate average salaries for Gremio and Internacional, Porto Alegre respondents supporting other clubs, and total respondents. Include zero salaries in the correct category average."@en,
        "For an empty category display No respondents in this category instead of dividing by zero; immediate termination produces zero counts and both empty-average messages. Display averages in reais to two decimal places."@en,
        "Read club code 1/2/3, nonnegative fractional salary and birthplace code 0/1. Club code 0 ends input before remaining fields are requested and is excluded from counts. Assume valid distinct respondent records."@en,
        "Submit source code. Explicit comparison of test outcomes and judgment is optional; no arrays, stored record collection, functions, invalid-input validation or individual explanation is prescribed."@en ;
